      "label": "man running away from a situation",
      "description": "A man in athletic attire is running outdoors on a paved path with a mountainous background and a cityscape below. The text overlay reads, 'i just heard my girlfriend is pregnant,' implying the man is running away from the news. The scene uses the visual metaphor of running to humorously convey shock, disbelief, or avoidance.",
