      "instance_name": "maternal_role",
      "label": "Maternal Role",
      "description": "The social and cultural expectation that women are primarily responsible for bearing and raising children. This concept is central to the meme’s context — the news of pregnancy directly relates to the woman’s role as a mother, and the man’s reaction is framed around his perceived responsibility or discomfort with this new role.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
