      "label": "Hyperbolic Exaggeration",
      "description": "A rhetorical device used to emphasize a point by exaggerating it to an extreme degree. In this meme, the man’s running away is a hyperbolic representation of his shock or discomfort, which is not a literal response but a comedic exaggeration to highlight the absurdity or intensity of the situation.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
