      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_7e52215d",
      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the man running away",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the man running, as the text 'i just heard my girlfriend is pregnant' uses the first-person pronoun 'i', indicating that the man in the image represents the speaker. The user identifies with the man's reaction, seeing themselves in his exaggerated, fleeing behavior. This projection is reinforced by the analogical mapping where the man is identified as 'me' in the meme context.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
